{"3724710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Gunstoppable", "steam_appid": 3724710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724710/extras/92a98686cf3d434874d80d50f195fa13.avif?t=1787618053\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724710/extras_big/92a98686cf3d434874d80d50f195fa13.webp?t=1787618053 width=1560 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724710/extras/0fdf7c177744d760c0a582bbb9a4f73f.poster.avif?t=1787618053\" width=1170 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724710/extras/0fdf7c177744d760c0a582bbb9a4f73f.webm?t=1787618053\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724710/extras/0fdf7c177744d760c0a582bbb9a4f73f.mp4?t=1787618053\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The speed limit is infinity.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The faster you move, the harder you hit. Grapple, slide, wall-run, and rail-grind to build momentum.  Dodge bullet-hell barrages with wild movement tech and perfectly timed parries. Rip through robots in style to rack up views as your rampage goes viral worldwide in a fully-voiced story campaign.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724710/extras/3186d34ffdbd75d672468807b88b478f.avif?t=1787618053\" width=1560 height=133 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsi